    'Tip: Tap anywhere on the map to walk there — tap a chest, tree or Critter to use it!',
    'Tip: Talk to Holiday Huggy 🎅, The Prototype 🦾, Poppy 🎀, Huggy Wuggy 🧸 & Kissy Missy 💗 right in Sunshine Village to recruit them!',
